{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40683","headline":"投献吏部张侍郎十韵 · 李洞","name":"投献吏部张侍郎十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苔染马蹄青，何曾似在城。\n不於僧院宿，多傍御沟行。\n隐岫侵巴叠，租田带渭平。\n肩囊寻省寺，袖轴徧公卿。\n梦入连涛郡，书来积雪营。\n泪随边雁堕，魂逐夜蝉惊。\n发愤巡江塔，无眠数县更。\n玄都一病客，兴善几回莺。\n贡艺披沙细，酬恩戴岳轻。\n心期公子念，滴酒在雕楹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}